{"id":"n15991-1-9","stage":2,"title":"멋지다 · 帅气","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15991-1-9-1","ko":"너는 콧수염을 기르면 더 멋질 거야.","zh":"你留胡子的话会更有型哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"콧수염을","meaning":"髭须，小胡子，八字胡","explanation":"콧수염：髭须，小胡子，八字胡；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"콧수염","audio":"/audio/cb90059c8bdfa101035e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81382","senseId":"1","lemma":"콧수염","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기르면","meaning":"留，蓄","explanation":"기르다：留，蓄；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"기르다","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62242","senseId":"6","lemma":"기르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멋질","meaning":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","explanation":"멋지다：帅气，潇洒，优秀；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"멋지다","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15991","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"cb90059c8bdfa101","term":"콧수염","zh":"髭须，小胡子，八字胡","audio":"/audio/cb90059c8bdfa101035e.mp3","entryId":"81382","definition":"长在鼻子下方的胡子。","pronunciation":["코쑤염","콛쑤염"]},{"id":"8b121394eb596253","term":"기르다","zh":"留，蓄","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3","entryId":"62242","definition":"让头发或胡须等长长。","pronunciation":["기르다"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"2b6551da3926436a","term":"멋지다","zh":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3","entryId":"15991","definition":"很好或很美。","pronunciation":["먿찌다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/50f79264661daf71e653.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15991-1-9-2","ko":"그래? 그럼 한번 길러 볼까?","zh":"是吗？那我就试试留吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길러","meaning":"留，蓄","explanation":"기르다：留，蓄；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"기르다","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62242","senseId":"6","lemma":"기르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼까?","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{